<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Report xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <GUID>b1080710-8775-4233-b083-54657628a00d</GUID>
  <Guide>&lt;p&gt;Usage and health of the reports, read from the audit database (table &lt;code&gt;sr_audit&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Last executions&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Schedule executions&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Long executions&lt;/strong&gt;: the report executions of the period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Usage by report&lt;/strong&gt;: per report, executions, distinct users, exports, navigations (sub-report or drill), empty results, errors, average and maximum duration, last event. The scheduled executions are excluded by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Checks&lt;/strong&gt;: the checks of the System report &lt;em&gt;310 Reports - Check Executions&lt;/em&gt; (option &lt;em&gt;Save results in the audit&lt;/em&gt;) not OK or longer than the threshold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Never executed&lt;/strong&gt;: the reports checked during the period that were never executed, exported or opened by a navigation during the same period (scheduled executions excluded).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who executed a report: tab &lt;strong&gt;Last executions&lt;/strong&gt; filtered on the path, or the tab &lt;strong&gt;Reports per user&lt;/strong&gt; of the report &lt;em&gt;250 Audit - Users Activity&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</Guide>
  <ViewGUID>9fcedc74-c7c0-4e79-9d09-5bcc17c3c2a4</ViewGUID>
